# Development tooling -- for writing exploits/tools, not pentest tools
# themselves, hence the separate category ("proper separation").
#
# VS Code and Sublime Text aren't in Kali's own repository at all (both
# are proprietary, each with their own apt repo/signing key) -- those are
# installed by config/hooks/normal/0160-install-external-dev-tools.hook.chroot
# instead, not listed here.

# golang-go alone (not the "golang" meta, which also pulls in
# golang-doc/golang-src -- extra docs/source bloat not worth it here).
golang-go
nodejs
npm
